Step 1: Same as T2, listed per process

This uses the join that already returned data in T2. It has no baseline, no single-APMID rule and no host lookup.

timeseries lat = avg(dt.process.network.latency),
           by:{dt.entity.process_group_instance}, from:-2h
| fieldsAdd latMs = round(arrayAvg(lat), decimals:2)
| lookup [ fetch dt.entity.process_group_instance | fields id, Process = entity.name, tags ],
         sourceField: dt.entity.process_group_instance, lookupField: id, prefix: "e."
| expand tag = e.tags
| filter startsWith(tag, "APMID:")
| fieldsAdd apmid = splitString(tag, "APMID:")[1]
| filter in(apmid, array($ClaimsApps))
| fields apmid, process = e.Process, latMs, dt.entity.process_group_instance
| sort latMs desc
| limit 15

