Step 2: Check the single-APMID rule

Run this only if Step 1 returns rows. It shows how many APMIDs each process carries:

fetch dt.entity.process_group_instance
| fields id, tags
| expand tag = tags
| filter startsWith(tag, "APMID:")
| summarize apmidCount = countDistinctExact(tag), by:{id}
| summarize processes = count(), by:{apmidCount}
| sort apmidCount asc
